title: One undo takes back a whole replace-all, and the file is clean again
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
forbid-log: nothing offers
expect-file: edit-odd/words.txt :: (?-i)\nfoo foofoo food\n

wait 3000
goto words.txt
wait 800
tool edit
edit words.txt 1 1
find foo
find replace-all bar
wait 300
mark replaced
wait 400
key undo
wait 300
mark undone
wait 400
find close
quit
wait 1200
answer Save and close
wait 800
